IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `model-constitution-domain`

§ `First Schedule — Model Constitution for a Private Company Limited by Shares`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies (Model Constitutions) Regulations 2015 (S 833/2015),
-- First Schedule (Regulation 2), regs 1–120.
--
-- This is the default constitution for a private company limited by
-- shares in Singapore. It applies unless the company adopts its own
-- constitution.
--
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Share capital and variation of rights — regs 7–12`


§§§ `reg 8 — Class rights variation`

-- reg 8(1)(a): consent in writing of 75% of class
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 8(1)(a)"
`class rights variation consent pct` MEANS 75

-- reg 8(2)(a): quorum for class meeting — 2 persons holding/representing
-- by proxy 1/3 of issued shares of the class
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 8(2)(a)"
`class meeting quorum persons` MEANS 2

GIVEN `proxy shares pct of class` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `class meeting quorum met` IF
    `proxy shares pct of class` AT LEAST 33.33


§§ `Lien — regs 13–16`

-- reg 14(2)(c): 14 days after notice before lien sale
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 14(2)(c)"
`lien sale notice days` MEANS 14


§§ `Calls on shares — regs 17–23`

-- reg 17(1)(a): no call payable less than 1 month after last call
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 17(1)(a)"
`minimum interval between calls months` MEANS 1

-- reg 17(1)(b): at least 14 days' notice for calls
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 17(1)(b)"
`call notice days` MEANS 14

-- reg 20(1): interest on unpaid calls — max 8% per annum
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 20(1)"
`unpaid call interest rate max pct` MEANS 8

-- reg 23(2): interest on advance payments — max 8% per annum (unless
-- company in general meeting otherwise directs)
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 23(2)"
`advance payment interest rate max pct` MEANS 8


§§ `Transfer of shares — regs 24–27`

-- reg 25(1)(b): maximum transfer fee $1
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 25(1)(b)"
`share transfer maximum fee` MEANS 1

-- reg 27: suspension of transfer lodging — max 30 days in any year
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 27"
`transfer suspension maximum days per year` MEANS 30


§§ `Forfeiture of shares — regs 32–39`

-- reg 33(a): forfeiture notice — at least 14 days to pay
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 33(a)"
`forfeiture notice minimum days` MEANS 14

-- reg 36(2): interest on forfeited shares — 8% per annum
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 36(2)"
`forfeiture interest rate pct` MEANS 8


§§ `General meeting — regs 47–50`

-- reg 49(1): at least 14 days' notice for general meetings
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 49(1)"
`general meeting notice days` MEANS 14


§§ `Proceedings at general meetings — regs 51–66`


§§§ `reg 51 — Quorum`

-- reg 51(2): default quorum — 2 members present in person
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 51(2)"
`general meeting quorum` MEANS 2


§§§ `reg 52 — No quorum within half an hour`

-- reg 52: half an hour grace period for quorum
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 52"
`quorum grace period minutes` MEANS 30


§§§ `reg 53 — Chairman`

-- reg 53(b)(ii): chairman must arrive within 15 minutes
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 53(b)(ii)"
`chairman arrival grace minutes` MEANS 15


§§§ `reg 54 — Adjournment`

-- reg 54(3): notice required if adjourned meeting > 30 days after original
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 54(3)"
`adjournment notice threshold days` MEANS 30


§§§ `reg 55 — Voting and poll demand`

-- reg 55(1): poll may be demanded by:
-- (b) at least 3 members present in person or by proxy
-- (c) member(s) representing >= 5% of total voting rights
-- (d) member(s) holding shares with >= 5% of total paid-up sum
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 55(1)"
GIVEN `members demanding poll`         IS A NUMBER
    , `voting rights pct of demanders` IS A NUMBER
    , `paid up pct of demanders`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may demand poll private co` IF
    `members demanding poll` AT LEAST 3
    OR `voting rights pct of demanders` AT LEAST 5
    OR `paid up pct of demanders` AT LEAST 5


§§§ `reg 57 — Casting vote`

-- reg 57: chairman has casting vote on equality
-- (declaratory — encoded as a boolean test)
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 57"
GIVEN `votes for`     IS A NUMBER
    , `votes against`  IS A NUMBER
    , `chairman votes for` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `resolution carried with casting vote` IF
    `votes for` GREATER THAN `votes against`
    OR (`votes for` EQUALS `votes against` AND `chairman votes for`)


§§§ `reg 58 — Votes`

-- reg 58(2): show of hands — 1 vote per member present
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 58(2)"
`votes per member show of hands` MEANS 1

-- reg 58(3): poll — 1 vote per share
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 58(3)"
`votes per share on poll` MEANS 1


§§§ `reg 61 — Unpaid calls bar voting`

-- reg 61: member cannot vote unless all calls paid
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 61"
GIVEN `all calls paid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `member entitled to vote` IF `all calls paid`


§§§ `reg 65 — Proxy deposit deadline`

-- reg 65(2)(a): proxy for poll — at least 24 hours before poll
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 65(2)(a)"
`proxy deposit hours before poll` MEANS 24

-- reg 65(2)(b): proxy for meeting — at least 72 hours before meeting
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 65(2)(b)"
`proxy deposit hours before meeting` MEANS 72


§§ `Directors — regs 67–76`


§§§ `reg 67 — Rotation of directors`

-- reg 67(2): at subsequent AGMs, 1/3 of directors retire
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 67(2)"
GIVEN `number of directors` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `directors to retire at AGM` IS
    IF (`number of directors` DIVIDED BY 3) EQUALS (`number of directors` DIVIDED BY 3)
    THEN `number of directors` DIVIDED BY 3
    ELSE `number of directors` DIVIDED BY 3

-- Simplified: always 1/3 (nearest integer handled by the company)

§§§ `reg 76 — Vacancy of office`

-- reg 76(h): absent > 6 months without permission
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 76(h)"
`director absence vacancy months` MEANS 6


§§ `Proceedings of directors — regs 83–94`


§§§ `reg 86 — Directors' quorum`

-- reg 86: default quorum for directors is 2
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 86"
`directors meeting quorum` MEANS 2


§§§ `reg 88 — Chairman grace period`

-- reg 88(2): chairman must arrive within 10 minutes
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 88(2)"
`directors chairman arrival minutes` MEANS 10


§§ `Dividends and reserves — regs 103–110`


§§§ `reg 105 — Dividends from profits only`

-- reg 105(a): no dividend except out of profits
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 105(a)"
GIVEN `proposed dividend`  IS A NUMBER
    , `available profits`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `dividend permitted` IF
    `proposed dividend` AT MOST `available profits`


§§ `Indemnity — regs 119–120`


§§§ `reg 119 — Officer indemnity`

-- reg 119: officer indemnified except for liability under s 172B(1)(a) or (b)
-- s 172B(1)(a): liability to the company itself
-- s 172B(1)(b): criminal fines / regulatory penalties
@ref "S 833/2015, First Schedule, reg 119"
GIVEN `is liability to company`  IS A BOOLEAN
    , `is criminal fine`         IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `officer indemnity available` IF
    NOT `is liability to company`
    AND NOT `is criminal fine`


-- ===========================================================================
-- TEST CASES
-- ===========================================================================

§§ `First Schedule — Illustrations`


-- reg 8: class rights
#ASSERT `class rights variation consent pct` EQUALS 75
#ASSERT `class meeting quorum persons` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `class meeting quorum met` 50
#ASSERT NOT (`class meeting quorum met` 30)

-- reg 14: lien sale notice
#ASSERT `lien sale notice days` EQUALS 14

-- reg 17: calls
#ASSERT `call notice days` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `unpaid call interest rate max pct` EQUALS 8

-- reg 25: transfer fee
#ASSERT `share transfer maximum fee` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `transfer suspension maximum days per year` EQUALS 30

-- reg 33: forfeiture notice
#ASSERT `forfeiture notice minimum days` EQUALS 14

-- reg 49: general meeting notice
#ASSERT `general meeting notice days` EQUALS 14

-- reg 51: quorum
#ASSERT `general meeting quorum` EQUALS 2

-- reg 55: poll demand
#ASSERT `may demand poll private co` 3 0 0
#ASSERT `may demand poll private co` 1 5 0
#ASSERT `may demand poll private co` 1 0 5
#ASSERT NOT (`may demand poll private co` 2 4 4)

-- reg 57: casting vote
#ASSERT `resolution carried with casting vote` 60 40 TRUE
#ASSERT `resolution carried with casting vote` 50 50 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`resolution carried with casting vote` 50 50 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`resolution carried with casting vote` 40 60 TRUE)

-- reg 58: votes
#ASSERT `votes per member show of hands` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `votes per share on poll` EQUALS 1

-- reg 61: voting eligibility
#ASSERT `member entitled to vote` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`member entitled to vote` FALSE)

-- reg 65: proxy deposit
#ASSERT `proxy deposit hours before poll` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `proxy deposit hours before meeting` EQUALS 72

-- reg 76: director absence
#ASSERT `director absence vacancy months` EQUALS 6

-- reg 86: directors quorum
#ASSERT `directors meeting quorum` EQUALS 2

-- reg 105: dividends
#ASSERT `dividend permitted` 100000 200000
#ASSERT `dividend permitted` 200000 200000
#ASSERT NOT (`dividend permitted` 300000 200000)

-- reg 119: officer indemnity
#ASSERT `officer indemnity available` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`officer indemnity available` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`officer indemnity available` FALSE TRUE)
